# The build context is the repository root; the image needs only these, so nothing else is sent to the builder.
*
!oss/core
!oss/verify
!oss/verify-pr
!oss/sign
!open_edition
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/node_modules
open_edition/web/app
# what proofpane_open/build.py keeps: one a run of it left in a checkout is no part of the image, whose own step writes it
open_edition/proofpane_open/build.json
# the desktop and phone apps, built on a person's own machine, are no part of the hosted app
open_edition/desktop
open_edition/phone
